that the shields are still locked?

07:15.227 --> 07:16.603
Sorry, teach me.

07:24.778 --> 07:26.864
I have a bad feeling.

07:41.712 --> 07:43.589
There they are. Get them off.

07:54.933 --> 07:57.394
Find a chancellor, R2.

08:05.777 --> 08:08.447
Chancellor's signal comes from here ...

08:08.572 --> 08:11.617
from the observatory
at the top of this tower.

08:11.742 --> 08:13.660
