09:05.712 --> 09:08.549
Drop your weapon.
I say, throw it away.

09:08.674 --> 09:10.551
OK.
- OK.

09:19.101 --> 09:21.019
These are certainly Jedi fighters.

09:26.441 --> 09:28.610
