We want to get started.

09:34.116 --> 09:37.953
R2, activate lift 31174.

09:38.829 --> 09:40.998
Get in, R2.
- What that?

09:41.123 --> 09:43.000
Do you hear, R2?

09:43.125 --> 09:46.545
R2, activate lift 31174.

09:47.462 --> 09:50.382
Back to work. Nothing that.

09:50.507 --> 09:53.427
Activate lift 31174.

09:53.552 --> 09:55.012
R2 ...

