10:07.399 --> 10:08.942
R2?

10:11.320 --> 10:12.905
R2! R2!

10:17.576 --> 10:20.245
Stop! Stop!
R2, we need to go up.

10:22.706 --> 10:24.583
Hands up, thirsty.

10:24.708 --> 10:26.877
