- Did I say something?

11:10.045 --> 11:11.964
Stick to it.
- I did not say anything.

11:49.626 --> 11:51.503
Chancellor.
- Are you ok?

11:51.628 --> 11:53.088
Count Duke.

11:57.843 --> 12:01.680
This time we'll be together.
- That's what I meant to say.

12:10.647 --> 12:13.859
Go for help. You're not up to him.
He is Lord Sito.

12:14.651 --> 12:18.030
Chancellor Palpatine,
Sito's masters are our specialty.

12:19.114 --> 12:20.991
Your swords, please.

12:21.116 --> 12:24.578
We do not want to make a mess
in front of the chancellor.

12:24.703 --> 12:26.914
