12:37.758 --> 12:39.843
I expected this.

12:39.968 --> 12:43.138
My powers have doubled
since our meeting, Count.

12:43.263 --> 12:46.725
Okay. Double ohol
double the fall.

13:06.829 --> 13:07.788
Come on...

13:33.063 --> 13:37.109
I feel a lot of fear in you, Skywalker.

13:38.235 --> 13:41.196
There is hatred in you.
There is anger.

13:41.989 --> 13:43.907
