14:22.905 --> 14:23.989
Kill him.

14:36.043 --> 14:38.962
You did well, Anakin.

14:39.713 --> 14:42.257
He was too dangerous
to live.

14:43.091 --> 14:45.469
Yes, but he was
unarmed prisoner.

14:45.594 --> 14:48.472
I was not supposed to do that.
Jedi do not work.

14:49.306 --> 14:53.685
That is normal. He cut off your hand,
and you wanted to take revenge.

14:53.810 --> 14:55.938
It was not your first time, Anakin.

14:56.939 --> 15:00.692
Do you remember what you were telling me?
about your mother and sandstones?

15:03.487 --> 15:07.074
Now we have to go,
before more droids come.

15:11.912 --> 15:14.456
Anakin, no time.

15:14.581 --> 15:16.917
We have to get off this ship
until it's too late.

15:18.669 --> 15:21.922
Looks good.
- Leave him, or we will not get there.

15:22.047 --> 15:24.091
His destiny will be the same as ours.

15:29.179 --> 15:31.348
Get ready for the attack!

15:33.642 --> 15:35.561
All batteries, burn! Fire away!

15:45.612 --> 15:47.531
