16:12.639 --> 16:15.893
Turn stabilizers.
- I'm turning the stabilizers.

16:35.162 --> 16:37.289
On magnetis! On magnetis!

16:43.879 --> 16:47.174
Auxiliary auxiliary engines.

16:52.221 --> 16:54.097
Correct.

17:09.863 --> 17:12.032
Slowly. We have a small problem.

17:12.157 --> 17:14.743
Have I missed something?
- Hold on.

17:14.868 --> 17:17.037
What is that?
- Yo.

17:17.162 --> 17:19.122
R2. R2, a second lift.

17:19.248 --> 17:20.457
Too late. Jump.

17:34.805 --> 17:38.433
Let's see if we can in the hangar
we find something that can still fly.

17:38.559 --> 17:40.644
R2, come here.

17:41.395 --> 17:43.021
R2, can you hear me?

17:48.694 --> 17:51.738
General, we found Jedi.
In the hall 328 are.

17:51.864 --> 17:54.199
Activate shields.

17:57.161 --> 17:58.453
Shields.

17:58.579 --> 18:01.456
Wait. How did it happen?
We're smarter.

18:01.582 --> 18:02.916
We do not seem to be.

18:04.918 --> 18:08.088
I recommend the agreement.
- Stressing?

18:08.964 --> 18:11.466
Yes. R2 will arrive
in a few moments ...

18:11.592 --> 18:14.303
