18:39.578 --> 18:41.914
Oh yes.

18:42.039 --> 18:44.124
Negotiator.

18:44.249 --> 18:48.462
General Kenobi.
We were expecting you.

18:48.587 --> 18:49.755
Sorry.

18:49.880 --> 18:53.592
That was not some rescue.
- You're welcome.

18:54.384 --> 18:55.844
I ...

18:56.595 --> 18:59.014
Anakin Skywalker.

18:59.139 --> 19:04.853
I expected someone to see you
to be a little ... older.

19:07.356 --> 19:11.276
General Grievous.
You're lower than I expected.

19:13.612 --> 19:15.197
The Jedi Swamp.

19:15.322 --> 19:18.784
We have business, Anakin.
Try not to disturb him.

19:22.913 --> 19:28.210
Your light swords will be
a nice addition to my collection.

19:28.335 --> 19:32.005
This time she will not.
And this time you will not win.

19:32.130 --> 19:33.131
R2.

19:38.136 --> 19:39.513
Crush them!

19:40.931 --> 19:42.975
Let them suffer.

19:47.020 --> 19:48.689
Come on. Immediately!

19:48.814 --> 19:50.983
Stay in your places!

19:57.656 --> 19:59.533
Hold it.

20:19.303 --> 20:20.387
Run away!

20:23.974 --> 20:25.851
Hell with them.

20:25.976 --> 20:28.270
Keep the ship in orbit.
- I understand.

20:38.530 --> 20:41.200
You lost, General Kenobi.

21:05.057 --> 21:07.100
Get out of here! Run away!

21:20.280 --> 21:22.741
