21:29.998 --> 21:32.376
All aircraft for departure
are launched.

21:32.501 --> 21:35.546
Grievus.
Do you know how to manage this ship?

21:35.671 --> 21:38.382
You think I'll let go of what's left?
- But?

21:38.507 --> 21:42.344
Under these conditions, I would say it is
The ability to manage this is irrelevant.

21:42.469 --> 21:43.637
