22:07.286 --> 22:09.746
No worries.
We still have half a boat.

22:15.419 --> 22:17.004
We really get on the speed.

22:25.679 --> 22:27.472
Eight plus 60.

22:28.390 --> 22:30.893
We're in the atmosphere.
- Hold it. Keep the horizontal.

22:44.781 --> 22:46.450
Quiet.

22:49.286 --> 22:50.621
Easy, R2.

22:53.832 --> 22:55.459
5000.

22:55.584 --> 22:57.503
Firefighters left and right.

22:57.628 --> 23:00.339
We'll take you.
- I understand.

23:02.758 --> 23:06.512
The runway is forward.
- We're overheated.

23:38.001 --> 23:39.962
Another happy ground.

24:09.825 --> 24:11.243
Are you coming, teach?

24:12.286 --> 24:15.789
Not. I am not too brave for politics.
I have to file a report to the Chamber.

24:15.914 --> 24:18.333
In addition, someone needs to show up.

24:18.458 --> 24:22.296
Wait.
The whole operation was your idea.

24:22.421 --> 24:25.549
Do not Forget, Anakin,
You saved me from the buzzer.

24:25.674 --> 24:28.051
And you killed Count Duku,
and you saved the chancellor ...

24:28.177 --> 24:30.095
carrying me out of the dark
on the back.

24:30.846 --> 24:32.681
All thanks to your training.

24:32.806 --> 24:36.310
Anakin, let's be honest.
Today you were a hero ...

24:36.435 --> 24:39.813
and you deserve your day of glory
among politicians.

24:39.938 --> 24:43.650
Okay. But you owe me a debt, and it does not
because I saved your skin for the tenth time.

24:43.775 --> 24:45.068
Ninth time.

24:45.777 --> 24:49.990
Keto Neimoidiom does not count.
We'll meet at the meeting.

24:55.370 --> 24:57.873
Chancellor Palpatine,
Are you ok?

24:57.998 --> 25:00.876
Yes. Thanking your two
Knight's Jedi.

25:01.001 --> 25:05.672
They killed Count Duku,
but General Grievus escaped again.

25:05.797 --> 25:09.301
General Grievus runs away and hides,
as always. It's a coward.

25:09.426 --> 25:13.722
But since Count Duku is dead,
He's the leader of the Droid Army.

25:13.847 --> 25:15.724
And I assure you ...

25:15.849 --> 25:19.561
that the Senate will vote to continue the war
as long as Grievus is alive.

25:19.686 --> 25:23.732
The larger Jedi will find Grievous
to put it first.

25:25.234 --> 25:27.110
Watch it.
- Excuse me.

25:27.236 --> 25:30.197
Come on, R2.
- The Republic has no words to thank you.

25:30.322 --> 25:32.449
Thank you, Senator.

25:33.492 --> 25:36.119
It can not be so bad.

25:36.870 --> 25:38.747
In that I agree with you.

25:38.872 --> 25:41.583
Actually, I need a service too.

25:41.708 --> 25:45.921
But the fight is continued as long as the general
Grievous does not spare spare parts.

25:46.964 --> 25:49.466
I will do everything I can in the Senate.

25:50.384 --> 25:52.302
Sorry.
- Of course.

26:02.437 --> 26:04.064
Oh, Anakin.

26:07.234 --> 26:09.111
You missed me, Padme.

26:10.320 --> 26:13.532
You whispered that you were killed.

26:13.657 --> 26:15.534
I'm all right.

26:16.743 --> 26:19.288
It seems like we were separated
whole eternity.

26:19.413 --> 26:22.207
That could have happened
that the chancellor did not kidnap.

26:22.332 --> 26:25.669
I think we would never return
from the siege of the Spherical Edge.

26:25.794 --> 26:28.422
Wait. Not here.
- Yes, here.

26:28.547 --> 26:32.009
I'm sitting all these fucking boots.
I do not care if they know we're married.

26:32.134 --> 26:34.386
Anakin, do not say that.

26:43.228 --> 26:46.815
Are you okay?
You're trembling.

26:46.940 --> 26:49.067
What's happening?

26:51.153 --> 26:53.322
Something wonderful happened.

26:55.240 --> 26:58.577
Ani, I'm pregnant.

27:02.623 --> 27:04.249
It is...

27:10.464 --> 27:12.049
That's wonderful.

27:14.801 --> 27:16.929
What can we do?

27:18.222 --> 27:21.808
Now, we will not be concerned about anything.
Okay?

27:22.601 --> 27:24.394
This is a happy moment.

27:26.396 --> 27:28.690
The happiest moment in my life.

28:34.548 --> 28:37.676
Yes, Lord Sidius?

28:37.801 --> 28:39.678
General Grievuse ...

28:39.803 --> 28:44.892
I suggest that the leaders of the separatists
transfer to Mustafar.

28:45.017 --> 28:48.061
I'll do it, my lord.

28:48.979 --> 28:53.233
The end of the war is approaching, General.

28:54.026 --> 28:56.945
But the loss of Count Duku ...

28:57.070 --> 29:01.200
His death is a necessary loss.

29:01.992 --> 29:05.621
Soon I will have a new student ...

29:05.746 --> 29:11.001
much younger
and much more powerful.

29:38.028 --> 29:41.031
Ani, I want our baby to be born
at home, at Nabu.

29:41.156 --> 29:44.493
We can go to the lakes,
where no one will know ...

29:44.618 --> 29:46.495
where we can be sure.

29:47.746 --> 29:50.040
I can go earlier
and fix a baby room.

29:53.919 --> 29:58.048
I know the perfect place.
Right next to the gardens.

30:02.636 --> 30:05.931
You are so Beautiful.

30:07.558 --> 30:09.601
It's just that
that I am so loved.

30:12.229 --> 30:14.356
No, that's because I am
so much for love with you.

30:16.441 --> 30:18.402
So, Love made you blind?

30:20.863 --> 30:22.906
I did not mean that much.

30:24.491 --> 30:26.535
But it's probably true.

30:36.170 --> 30:38.255
Anakin, help me!

31:40.901 --> 31:42.819
What's bothering you?

31:45.906 --> 31:47.241
Nothing.

31:49.493 --> 31:51.537
I remember when I gave you this.

31:52.454 --> 31:55.833
How long will it take to become
Sincere to each other?

31:58.919 --> 32:01.880
I dreamed something.
- Bad?

32:02.673 --> 32:07.094
Like what I dreamed of
about the mother, just before she died.

32:07.219 --> 32:08.512
And?

32:11.974 --> 32:13.892
I dreamed of you.

32:16.562 --> 32:17.771
Excuse me.

32:20.190 --> 32:22.067
It was just a dream.

32:35.038 --> 32:36.957
You're dying at birth.

32:37.833 --> 32:39.877
A baby?

32:40.627 --> 32:42.296
I do not know.

32:44.464 --> 32:48.010
It was just a dream.
- I will not let this dream come true.

32:49.720 --> 32:51.763
Baby will change our life.

32:52.723 --> 32:55.684
I doubt that the Queen will let me
Yes, and I'll be in the Senate.

32:55.809 --> 32:58.187
If the Chamber finds out that you are your father,
will throw you out ...

32:58.312 --> 33:00.230
I know.

33:01.607 --> 33:04.610
Do you think Obi-Van?
could he help us?

33:06.653 --> 33:08.655
