33:10.449 --> 33:12.993
Our baby is a blessing.

33:29.218 --> 33:30.677
Suspicion?

33:30.802 --> 33:32.262
Awareness.

33:33.472 --> 33:35.599
These visions ...

33:37.392 --> 33:40.312
These are visions of pain, suffering.

33:42.606 --> 33:44.149
Death.

33:44.274 --> 33:48.654
You talk about yourself
or about someone you know?

33:50.614 --> 33:52.157
About someone.

33:52.282 --> 33:54.159
Close to you?

33:55.369 --> 33:56.829
Yes.

33:57.704 --> 34:01.542
You have to be careful
when you are experiencing the future, Anakin.

34:01.667 --> 34:05.963
Fear of loss is the path
to the dark side.

34:08.215 --> 34:10.717
I will not let you
These visions are realized, teach Yude.

34:11.593 --> 34:14.763
Death is a natural part of life.

34:14.888 --> 34:19.560
Rejoice over those around you
which is transformed into the Force.

34:19.685 --> 34:22.938
Do not complain.
Let them not reach you.

34:23.063 --> 34:26.149
Privileges are led by jealousy.

34:26.275 --> 34:29.695
It's the shadow of greed.

34:29.820 --> 34:32.030
What should I do, teach me Yoda?

34:32.739 --> 34:35.784
Learn not to tie ...

34:35.909 --> 34:39.329
for all that you are afraid to lose.

34:50.048 --> 34:52.593
You missed the report
about the siege of the Knife Edge.

34:53.927 --> 34:56.305
Excuse me. I kept it.

34:56.430 --> 35:00.309
I have no excuse.
- In short, it takes place very well.

35:00.434 --> 35:05.606
Saleukami fell, and teach him Vos
he transferred the troops to Boz Piti.

35:05.731 --> 35:07.608
What's wrong then?

35:09.109 --> 35:13.906
The Senate is expected to deliver today
more executive power for the chancellor.

35:14.031 --> 35:18.368
It just means less notice
and more action. Is that bad?

35:18.494 --> 35:20.913
It will make it easier for us
to end this war.

35:22.664 --> 35:24.958
Beware of your friend Palpatine.

35:26.627 --> 35:28.504
What can I keep?

35:28.629 --> 35:31.256
He was looking for your presence.
- Why?

35:31.381 --> 35:33.550
He did not want to say.

35:33.675 --> 35:37.221
Did not he inform the Council?
That's unusual, is not it?

35:37.346 --> 35:39.556
All this is unusual.

35:39.681 --> 35:42.017
And that's what worries me.

35:57.115 --> 35:58.992
I hope you trust me, Anakin.

36:00.035 --> 36:01.245
Of course.

36:02.412 --> 36:04.289
I need your help, son.

36:05.457 --> 36:07.459
What do you mean?

36:08.252 --> 36:10.128
I count on you.

36:10.838 --> 36:12.756
For what? I do not understand.

36:12.881 --> 36:18.470
To be your eyes, your ears
and the voice of the Republic.

36:20.806 --> 36:24.935
I name you for my personal
representatives in the Jedi Council.

36:25.060 --> 36:26.395
Me?

36:27.104 --> 36:28.564
Teacher?

36:29.940 --> 36:31.817
I'm happy, sir.

36:33.735 --> 36:36.822
But the Chamber only elects its members.
They will not accept this.

36:36.947 --> 36:40.450
I think they will.
You need them.

36:41.368 --> 36:43.245
More than you think.

36:53.672 --> 36:58.427
This appointment of the Council
will not be easy to approve.

36:58.552 --> 37:01.972
This move cares
Chancellor Palpatine.

37:03.182 --> 37:04.725
I understand.

37:04.850 --> 37:07.186
You are in the Council,

37:07.311 --> 37:09.897
but we do not give you
Rank is taught.

37:10.981 --> 37:12.024
What?

37:17.613 --> 37:20.491
How can you do it?
This is unheard of.

37:20.616 --> 37:22.159
It's unlawful.

37:24.161 --> 37:27.372
How can you be in the Council
not to learn?

37:28.165 --> 37:31.001
Sit down, young Skywalker.

37:34.087 --> 37:35.714
Excuse me, teach me.

37:39.927 --> 37:42.346
We searched
all systems in the Republic ...

37:42.471 --> 37:46.183
but we did not find a trace
General Grievous.

37:46.308 --> 37:49.061
Grievous is hiding in the Communication edge.

37:49.186 --> 37:52.272
You need to search for remote systems.

37:52.397 --> 37:54.608
We can not separate a lot of ships.

37:54.733 --> 37:56.902
What about the droid attack
on Vukije?

37:57.986 --> 38:00.697
It's necessary to go right there
We are sending a group of attackers.

38:00.823 --> 38:04.243
He is right. That system
we must not lose.

38:05.577 --> 38:07.663
I'll go.

38:07.788 --> 38:10.791
I'm in good relations with the Wookiees.

38:10.916 --> 38:12.501
Then it's solved.

38:12.626 --> 38:17.631
Joda will take the clone of clones
as reinforcement of the Vukijim on Kašik.

38:17.756 --> 38:19.800
Let the Power be with all of us.

38:22.052 --> 38:24.680
What's that nonsense?

38:24.805 --> 38:27.182
Prime me to the Council
but they do not give me the title of the teacher.

38:27.307 --> 38:30.060
That's in the history of Jedi
it never happened. It's an insult.

38:30.185 --> 38:33.021
Calm down, Anakin.
It's a great honor.

38:33.146 --> 38:36.108
Being in the Council at your age ...
it never happened before.

38:37.276 --> 38:40.654
It's about
that you are too close to the chancellor.

38:40.779 --> 38:44.533
The Chamber does not like it when it blends
in the affairs of the Jedi.

38:44.658 --> 38:48.036
I swear to you,
I did not ask to be in the Council.

38:48.162 --> 38:50.372
Did you want that?

38:50.497 --> 38:53.792
Your friendship with the Chancellor
Palpatine seems to have paid off.

38:53.917 --> 38:55.794
It has nothing to do with this.

38:55.919 --> 38:58.839
The only reason the Chamber approved it
your appointment,

38:58.964 --> 39:01.300
is that the Chancellor believes you.

39:02.050 --> 39:03.302
And?

39:04.011 --> 39:07.181
Anakin, on your side.
I did not want to get you into this situation.

39:07.306 --> 39:08.473
What situation?

39:12.561 --> 39:16.899
The Chamber wants you to report it
about all the actions of the chancellor.

39:17.024 --> 39:19.359
They want to know what he's up to.

39:23.906 --> 39:25.908
Want to follow the chancellor?

39:26.825 --> 39:29.495
But it's a betrayal.
- It's a war, Anakin.

39:31.538 --> 39:34.458
Why did not the Chamber give me this task?
while we were at the meeting?

39:34.583 --> 39:37.002
This task must not be public.

39:38.128 --> 39:41.048
The chancellor is not a bad man, Obi-Vane.

39:41.173 --> 39:44.176
He talked to me. Watch out for me
Since I came here.

39:44.301 --> 39:46.386
That's why you have to help us.

39:46.512 --> 39:49.973
Anakin, we are dedicated to the Senate,
not his leader ...

39:50.098 --> 39:53.769
who managed to remain in position
long after the expiration of the mandate.

39:53.894 --> 39:55.854
The Senate demanded
to stay longer.

39:55.979 --> 39:59.149
Yes, but he uses his feelings, Anakin.
Something is not right.

40:00.526 --> 40:03.445
You're asking me to do something
which contradicts the codex of Jedi.

40:04.404 --> 40:07.449
Against the Republic.
Against mentors and friends.

40:07.574 --> 40:11.537
That's not right.
Why are you asking me?

40:13.872 --> 40:15.749
The Chamber seeks.

40:22.714 --> 40:26.677
Anakin did not accept his new task
with lots of excitement.

40:27.594 --> 40:30.764
It's very dangerous
merge them two.

40:30.889 --> 40:33.183
I do not think Anakin does
can with this end come to an end.

40:33.308 --> 40:35.227
I have no confidence in him.

40:35.936 --> 40:39.147
With due respect, learn,
Is not he the one chosen?

40:39.898 --> 40:43.569
Should not he destroy Site
and to bring balance to the Force?

40:44.361 --> 40:46.530
So it says the prophecy.

40:46.655 --> 40:51.535
A prophecy that maybe
misinterpreted.

40:53.370 --> 40:55.247
He will not let me down.

40:55.372 --> 40:57.291
He never let me down.

40:57.416 --> 41:00.419
I hope you're right.

41:25.486 --> 41:28.322
Sometimes I wonder what's going on
with a row of jewels.

41:29.239 --> 41:32.284
I think this war is destroying
principles of the Republic.

41:34.161 --> 41:37.331
Have you ever thought
that we may be on the wrong side?

41:37.456 --> 41:39.333
What do you mean?

41:41.043 --> 41:44.630
What if the democracy we served
no longer exists,

41:44.755 --> 41:48.342
and the Republic has become just that evil
for whose destruction we are fighting?

41:49.176 --> 41:52.679
I do not believe.
And you sound like a separatist.

41:54.681 --> 41:57.601
This war means
less hearing.

41:57.726 --> 41:59.728
You are now closer to the Chancellor
than anybody.

41:59.853 --> 42:03.106
Please, ask him to stop the fighting
and allow diplomacy to continue.

42:03.232 --> 42:05.776
Do not ask me to do it.

42:07.361 --> 42:10.989
Submit a proposal to the Senate,
where such a request belongs.

42:11.865 --> 42:13.909
What is it?
- Nothing.

42:15.244 --> 42:19.081
Do not do it. Do not get me wrong.
Let me help you.

42:21.875 --> 42:23.335
Hug me.

42:23.460 --> 42:25.712
Like you hugged me
next to the lake on Nabu.

42:26.880 --> 42:29.550
So long ago, when it did not exist
nothing but our Love.

42:30.759 --> 42:34.179
No politics, no conspiracy, no war.

43:13.427 --> 43:16.096
You wanted me to come, Chancellor.
- Yes, Anakin.

43:16.221 --> 43:18.182
Come closer. I have good news.

43:19.892 --> 43:21.768
Our units
clones of intelligence ...

43:21.894 --> 43:24.938
they discovered
where General Grievus is.

43:25.063 --> 43:27.649
It is hiding in Utapau.

43:27.774 --> 43:28.942
Finally.

43:30.360 --> 43:33.530
We can catch that monster
and to end this war.

43:33.655 --> 43:36.992
I would be worried about wisdom
of the entire Council ...

43:37.117 --> 43:39.495
not to choose you for this task.

43:39.620 --> 43:42.956
You are by far the best choice.

43:46.001 --> 43:47.461
Have a seat.

43:47.586 --> 43:48.795
Leave us.

44:03.352 --> 44:07.814
You know I can not rely on it
to the Jedi Council.

44:09.608 --> 44:12.945
If they have not already gotten you
In his plot, he will soon.

44:13.904 --> 44:15.989
I'm not sure I understand.

44:16.114 --> 44:19.785
You must feel what I feel.

44:19.910 --> 44:23.288
More Jedi
wants to control the Republic.

44:24.665 --> 44:26.583
They're planning to betray me.

44:27.292 --> 44:29.670
I do not think so...
- Anakin.

44:30.879 --> 44:32.798
Examine your feelings.

44:35.008 --> 44:37.553
You know that, do not you?

44:41.974 --> 44:43.851
I know they do not believe you.

44:43.976 --> 44:47.271
Not the Senate.
Not the Republic.

44:47.396 --> 44:49.982
Not democracy, if we do.

44:50.774 --> 44:55.112
I have to admit that it is my trust
in them.

44:55.237 --> 44:56.697
Why?

44:58.907 --> 45:03.162
They asked you to do something
What looks unfair to you, is not it?

45:06.206 --> 45:09.042
They asked me to follow me, did not I?

45:13.547 --> 45:15.174
I do not...

45:16.216 --> 45:18.093
I do not know what to say.

45:18.218 --> 45:21.680
Remember
what you learned at the beginning.

45:22.389 --> 45:26.185
All who are able to gain power
They are afraid that they will not lose.

45:26.310 --> 45:30.939
Even Jedi.
- The Jedi use their power for good.

45:31.064 --> 45:33.192
Good depends
from the point of view, Anakin.

45:33.317 --> 45:38.489
City and Jedi
are almost everything similar ...

45:40.532 --> 45:43.285
including the desire
for more power.

45:44.828 --> 45:47.831
The cities draw strength from their passion.

45:47.956 --> 45:50.709
They think inward -
just for yourself.

45:51.919 --> 45:54.171
And not the Jedi?

45:55.047 --> 45:58.842
Jedi are unselfish.
They care only about others.

46:09.019 --> 46:13.982
Have you ever heard of a tragedy?
Darta Plaguesa Wise?

46:19.112 --> 46:23.158
And I thought you were not. That story
Jedi would not tell you.

46:24.618 --> 46:26.578
It's the legend of the Sita.

46:27.538 --> 46:31.708
Dart Plagues was
Dark Lord of the Seas ...

46:31.834 --> 46:34.711
so powerful and wise ...

46:34.837 --> 46:39.675
that he could use Silu
to affect the midichlorans ...

46:39.800 --> 46:42.970
to create ... life.

46:44.638 --> 46:47.683
So he knew the dark side ...

46:47.808 --> 46:52.271
that even those he likes could have
to save ...

46:53.397 --> 46:54.857
from death.

46:59.153 --> 47:02.948
He could really have saved her
People from death?

47:03.824 --> 47:08.328
Dark side of the Force
the way to many abilities ...

47:08.453 --> 47:12.666
which some consider unnatural.

47:13.750 --> 47:15.627
What happened to him?

47:16.670 --> 47:18.797
He became so powerful ...

47:20.090 --> 47:22.176
that he was the only one to fear ...

47:23.385 --> 47:25.262
was a loss of power.

47:25.387 --> 47:27.514
Which, of course, eventually happened.

47:28.724 --> 47:33.896
Unfortunately, he taught his student
everything he knew.

47:34.688 --> 47:37.316
Then the student killed him at bedtime.

47:40.527 --> 47:42.279
Irony.

47:42.404 --> 47:44.531
He could save others from death ...

47:45.657 --> 47:47.743
And not yourself.

47:51.914 --> 47:54.458
Is it possible to get such a power?

47:58.295 --> 48:00.422
Not from Jedi.

48:17.314 --> 48:19.191
All the Red units here!

48:30.994 --> 48:33.372
Palpatine thinks General Grievus is
on Utapau?

48:34.206 --> 48:36.083
They intercepted part of the message ...

48:36.208 --> 48:38.669
in diplomatic mail
from President Utapau.

48:41.255 --> 48:43.340
We have to do something.

48:44.591 --> 48:48.178
Capturing General Grievous
will end this war.

48:49.304 --> 48:52.099
Quickly and decisively
We have to work.

48:53.016 --> 48:57.229
The chancellor asked ...
to lead a march.

48:58.021 --> 49:00.649
The Chamber will only decide
who will go ...

49:00.774 --> 49:02.734
not a chancellor.

49:02.860 --> 49:07.781
It is necessary to study,
someone more experienced.

49:07.906 --> 49:11.285
I agree.
Teach Kenobi to go.

49:12.494 --> 49:13.912
I agree.

49:14.037 --> 49:15.164
Yes.

49:15.289 --> 49:16.832
Yes.

49:16.957 --> 49:18.876
Okay. The meeting is over.

49:26.800 --> 49:29.469
Drugs were launched
main generators.

49:30.304 --> 49:35.058
Now is the time, Commander.
- Yes sir.

49:47.738 --> 49:49.198
You're hurting!

50:04.338 --> 50:06.256
U zaklon!

50:21.688 --> 50:24.566
I'll need you for this.
- I agree.

50:24.691 --> 50:27.528
However, it can be shown
that we are on the wrong track.

50:27.653 --> 50:28.779
Learn.

50:30.697 --> 50:36.036
I disappointed you. I'm not comfortable
appreciated your learning.

50:36.161 --> 50:39.915
I was a kid
And I apologize.

50:40.666 --> 50:43.001
But I am so unhappy with the Council.

50:46.338 --> 50:50.050
You are strong and wise, Anakin,
and I'm proud of you.

50:50.175 --> 50:52.761
I train you out of the way.

50:52.886 --> 50:54.972
I've taught you everything I know.

50:55.097 --> 50:58.851
And you became a lot of Jedi Jedi
than I'll ever be.

50:59.726 --> 51:01.645
But be patient, Anakin.

51:02.521 --> 51:05.691
The Chamber will soon give you
called by the teacher.

51:13.073 --> 51:16.326
Obi-Vane,
let the Power come with you.

51:16.451 --> 51:19.329
Good-bye, old friend.
Let the Power come with you.

51:41.935 --> 51:46.482
Fortunately, most cities are concentrated
on this small continent.

51:46.607 --> 51:48.233
On the other hand.

51:48.358 --> 51:50.652
I'll draw their attention
until you arrive.

51:50.777 --> 51:54.198
Just do not stay long.
- Well, did I ever let you down?

51:55.616 --> 52:00.746
Okay. It's not for me to destroy it
All droids until you arrive.

52:26.188 --> 52:27.940
Save energy.

52:28.649 --> 52:30.400
Can not.

52:30.526 --> 52:32.277
Do not give up, Padme.

52:45.749 --> 52:47.626
Obi-Van was here, was not he?

52:48.335 --> 52:50.379
He dropped this morning.

52:51.797 --> 52:53.674
What did he want?

52:53.799 --> 52:55.717
Take care of you.

52:58.220 --> 53:00.472
He says you're under a lot of pressure.

53:03.350 --> 53:05.018
I feel lost.

53:06.186 --> 53:09.314
Lost? What do you mean?

53:11.233 --> 53:13.610
Obi-Van and the Chamber do not believe me.

53:14.695 --> 53:17.114
They trust you with all your heart.

53:18.866 --> 53:20.325
Something is happening.

53:21.493 --> 53:23.662
I'm not a jaddy like I should be.

53:26.039 --> 53:27.958
I want more.

53:29.209 --> 53:31.086
And I know I should not.

53:33.213 --> 53:35.174
You demand too much from yourself.

53:39.178 --> 53:42.347
I've found a way to save you.
- To save me?

53:42.472 --> 53:44.391
Out of my basketball.

53:44.516 --> 53:46.435
Does that bother you?

53:47.478 --> 53:49.396
I do not want to lose you, Padme.

53:50.230 --> 53:52.316
I will not die at birth, Ani.

53:52.441 --> 53:54.860
I assure you.
- No, I assure you.

54:38.821 --> 54:41.198
Hello, young Jedi.

54:41.323 --> 54:44.743
What brings you
to our remote haven?

54:44.868 --> 54:46.787
Unfortunately, war.

54:47.579 --> 54:51.458
There is no war here ...
unless you bring it with you.

54:51.583 --> 54:54.753
If you let me, I need fuel ...

54:54.878 --> 54:59.800
and your city for the base while I'm looking for the general
Grievous in nearby systems.

55:08.809 --> 55:12.062
Here is.
It keeps us hostage.

55:12.187 --> 55:15.065
They're watching us.
- I understand.

55:15.190 --> 55:19.987
Tenth level,
hi droids of combat droids.

55:20.112 --> 55:22.531
Tell your people to go to the shelter.

55:22.656 --> 55:25.617
If you have warriors, now is the time.

55:36.545 --> 55:40.757
Take a boatman.
Tell the Cody that I've made contact.

55:42.718 --> 55:46.805
Does he bring more warriors?
- He did not say.

56:29.139 --> 56:34.353
Army of the Republic, fast
they will find us here.

56:36.980 --> 56:42.194
I'm sending you to the Mustafar system
on the Communication edge.

56:49.701 --> 56:51.995
It's a planet of volcanic origin.

56:52.120 --> 56:55.415
There you will be sure.
- Safe?

56:56.250 --> 56:59.503
Chancellor Palpatine managed to
Move to your distress, General.

56:59.628 --> 57:04.049
No Count Duku, I doubt
that you can protect us.

57:04.967 --> 57:10.097
Be grateful, vicekraLju,
you did not find me in the hand.

57:13.600 --> 57:16.228
Your ship is waiting.

57:34.121 --> 57:35.372
Hello.

57:38.041 --> 57:39.751
General Kenobi.

57:42.713 --> 57:45.257
You're very brave.

57:47.301 --> 57:48.760
Kill him.

58:04.610 --> 58:06.028
Back.

58:06.153 --> 58:10.741
I'll deal with this myself
I'm garbage from the jade.

58:10.866 --> 58:12.326
You're on the move.

58:13.160 --> 58:14.870
You fool.

58:14.995 --> 58:20.792
Count Duku taught me
Your Jedi skills.

58:27.341 --> 58:29.801
In the attack, Kenobi.

59:46.170 --> 59:48.463
Had an army or not ...

59:48.589 --> 59:53.677
you surely realize you're done.

59:53.802 --> 59:55.762
I would not say.

01:00:54.196 --> 01:00:55.948
Cover that corner.

01:01:01.995 --> 01:01:04.039
LearnLu Vindu, can I interrupt you?

01:01:04.164 --> 01:01:06.917
General Kenobi came into contact
with General Grievous ...

01:01:07.042 --> 01:01:09.294
and we started the attack.

01:01:09.419 --> 01:01:11.129
Thank you, commander.

01:01:11.255 --> 01:01:15.342
Anakin, bring it to the chancellor
this report.

01:01:15.467 --> 01:01:17.719
His reaction will show us
what's going on.

01:01:17.845 --> 01:01:19.304
Yes, teach me.

01:01:26.770 --> 01:01:29.231
I feel conspiracy to destroy the Jedi.

01:01:30.149 --> 01:01:32.609
The Dark Side of the Force
surrounds the chancellor.

01:01:33.318 --> 01:01:35.529
If after the destruction of Grievous
does not give up ...

01:01:35.654 --> 01:01:37.531
authorities...

01:01:37.656 --> 01:01:39.867
then we need to get him out of position.

01:01:41.368 --> 01:01:43.871
The larger the Jedi must
take control of the Senate ...

01:01:43.996 --> 01:01:45.873
to ensure a quiet transition.

01:01:45.998 --> 01:01:50.460
If this is how we think of darkness
will take us under his own.

01:01:52.713 --> 01:01:55.424
We have to be very careful.

01:02:02.264 --> 01:02:03.724
Chancellor.

01:02:04.516 --> 01:02:07.019
We just received a report
from the teacher Kenobi.

01:02:07.144 --> 01:02:09.771
He broke up with General Grievous.

01:02:09.897 --> 01:02:13.233
Let's just hope it is
Learn Kenobi to come up with a challenge.

01:02:15.277 --> 01:02:17.237
I should be there with him.

01:02:17.362 --> 01:02:19.698
It bothers me
what I see is the Chamber ...

01:02:19.823 --> 01:02:21.867
Does not appreciate your gift
completely.

01:02:23.202 --> 01:02:27.289
You're not wondering why
Will not they call you teacher?

01:02:28.999 --> 01:02:30.959
I would like to know.

01:02:32.294 --> 01:02:34.755
I feel more and more ...

01:02:34.922 --> 01:02:37.132
to excuse me from the Council.

01:02:44.139 --> 01:02:48.060
I know there's something there
they do not tell me about Sila.

01:02:50.312 --> 01:02:52.689
They do not believe you, Anakin.

01:02:53.482 --> 01:02:55.484
See your future.

01:02:55.609 --> 01:02:59.446
They know your power will be too strong
to control it.

01:03:00.656 --> 01:03:05.702
You have to break through a network of lies
which the Jedi splintered around you.

01:03:07.746 --> 01:03:11.875
Let me help you learn
fine Force.

01:03:12.626 --> 01:03:14.753
How do you know all this about the Force?

01:03:15.796 --> 01:03:18.841
My mentor taught me
all about the Force.

01:03:19.633 --> 01:03:22.594
Even the nature of the dark side.

01:03:24.596 --> 01:03:26.932
Do you know the dark side?

01:03:29.560 --> 01:03:32.855
To understand this great secret ...

01:03:32.980 --> 01:03:35.357
you should study all of her sides ...

01:03:35.482 --> 01:03:38.610
not just dogmatic
narrow vision of the Jedi.

01:03:39.361 --> 01:03:42.489
If you want to become
a complete and wise leader ...

01:03:42.614 --> 01:03:46.285
you have to take a wider view of Sil.

01:03:47.035 --> 01:03:49.037
Beware of Jedi, Anakin.

01:03:50.080 --> 01:03:55.252
Only with me can you reach
greater power than any jade.

01:03:56.003 --> 01:03:58.630
Learn the dark side of the Force ...

01:03:58.755 --> 01:04:02.384
and you can save your wife ...

01:04:02.509 --> 01:04:04.553
from certain death.

01:04:05.679 --> 01:04:07.556
What did you say?

01:04:07.681 --> 01:04:11.310
Use my knowledge. Please.

01:04:13.020 --> 01:04:15.189
You are the Master of Sita.

01:04:15.314 --> 01:04:19.151
I know what's bothering you.
Listen to me.

01:04:20.152 --> 01:04:23.822
Do not even be a pawn
Greater Jedi.

01:04:25.991 --> 01:04:29.411
Since when I know you,
looking for life,

